# Mesh Hop 0.5.1, multitasking (X-Background=run; the launcher's APP-CONTRACT section 13): the runner plays the launcher. Run with
# SIMCTL=1 (run_flows.sh does): `sim msg` is a direct message from Alice. Hidden, the radio link and the model keep going but nothing is
# drawn (not one flush) and nothing counts as read, even in the conversation that is open; shown again, the whole screen is repainted
# with what came meanwhile.
lifecycle
wait 3500
key enter
wait 500
say == Chats, connected (expect tab=Chats link=Connected)
dump

# the list in front: a message while hidden is counted and shown on return
mark
hide
expect hidden
sim msg first while hidden
wait 2500
say == hidden: the message came in (unread one more), not one flush
dump
expect more unread
expect nowrite
show
wait 500
expect visible
expect repaint
say == shown: the list with the new unread count
dump
expect more unread
shot 01-list-after

# Alice's conversation open: a message while hidden stays unread until the app is in front again, then it is read
tap "Alice"
tap "Alice"
wait 800
say == Alice's conversation open
dump
mark
hide
sim msg second while hidden
wait 2500
say == hidden: one more message, unread (nobody saw it)
dump
expect more msgs
expect more unread
expect nowrite
show
wait 600
expect repaint
say == shown: the conversation shows it and it is read
dump
expect more msgs
expect same unread
shot 02-conversation-after
